message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "artifact-signals: pre-registered diagnostic signals for benchmark artifacts in LLM reasoning evaluation"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: th00masml
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/th00masml/connect"
abstract: >-
  An instrument for distinguishing genuine reasoning capability from benchmark artifacts:
  six diagnostic signals reported as an Artifact Risk Profile, five interventions with
  manipulation checks, and a hashed prediction ledger scored against a naive predictor.
keywords:
  - evaluation
  - benchmark artifacts
  - language models
  - reasoning
  - preregistration
